{"timestamp":"2026-11-24T03:57:57.877Z","ordinal":104069,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1f54f-2cb2-7201-ad27-acf2d9bbd90e","turn_id":"01a20bb2-48c0-7db0-bfc5-137d3a66f0eb","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-14c0ebca-2f34-4861-ab02-7bc564f0ea75","process_id":"22724","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git rev-parse origin/release/v1.3.0; git log -1 --oneline origin/release/v1.3.0; git status --short --branch; git diff -- docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md; git diff --check"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/context-maturity-v130","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git rev-parse origin/release/v1.3.0; git log -1 --oneline origin/release/v1.3.0; git status --short --branch; git diff -- docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md; git diff --check"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"2dea217937aa7b49a0719b4bbfe3d9a9f9658acd\n2dea2179 Merge pull request #767 from mikeholownych/v1/verify-cancel-orphan\n## codex/context-maturity-v130...origin/release/v1.3.0 [ahead 39, behind 12]\n M docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md\n?? .cargo-target-context-maturity/\n?? cli/.local/\ndiff --git a/docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md b/docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md\nindex 4437f678..36296b08 100644\n--- a/docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md\n+++ b/docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md\n@@ -194,3 +194,9 @@ Results from the corrected run: Rust core tests passed 53/53, Rust TUI tests pas\n The outer validation command nevertheless returned exit code 1 after the security gates printed success, with `zsh:42: PIPESTATUS[0]: parameter not set`. Thus the component summaries are green, but the aggregate shell-wrapper status was not captured cleanly; this record does not label the aggregate command as a verified exit-0 run. The exact command output is retained at `/tmp/context-maturity-make-test-2b623b44-fixed.log`. The command's own evaluator tmpfs and runtime roots were removed after its process exited; the separate isolated HOME is retained for diagnostics. The owner checkout and the shared fixture paths were not modified.\n \n These results supersede the older predecessor-only suite reports as the most recent full-suite evidence, but establish local component qualification only. The maturity ratings remain Navigability 2 — Exploratory, Retrieval speed 2 — Exploratory, Freshness 1 — Ad hoc, and Compounding value 1 in the no-memory fixture / 2 only when durable context is observed. There is still no held-out evidence that durable memory improves task outcomes, no measured retrieval SLO or end-to-end latency distribution, and durable-memory freshness remains unknown where source fingerprints are unavailable. Hosted checks, installed acceptance, independent review, and a fresh full run whose outer command exits zero remain outstanding. No inference provider was modified, and no push, PR, merge, or tag was performed.\n+\n+### Validation update — 2026-11-24, current rebased release snapshot\n+\n+On implementation head `52b54573264a1ac563119a9f318e57affc3a2753`, based on `release/v1.3.0` at `d03e6199f37bd024f17a807f00ed261291f8a02c`, `make build` passed in an isolated snapshot. The subsequent exact-head `make test` completed its Rust and terminal-security stages but failed in the second CLI shard. Rust core passed 53/53, Rust TUI passed 406/406, and the other Rust integration groups passed (1/1, 3/3, 4/4, and 1/1); the first CLI shard reported 3,108/3,112 passed with 4 skipped. The second CLI shard reported 3,057 tests: 3,043 passed, 1 failed, and 13 skipped. Its sole failure was `test/turn_semantics.test.ts`, “the same trajectory with a passing verifier is VERIFIED only through the verifier run”: expected `execution === COMPLETED`, received `FAILED`. Terminal scope fixtures passed and all lifecycle security gates printed success, but `make test` ended with `make: *** [Makefile:67: test] Error 1`; this is a failed aggregate run.\n+\n+The complete `turn_semantics.test.ts` file was then run alone on the same snapshot with an isolated HOME and passed 37/37 in 94.2 seconds. This non-reproduction does not erase the full-suite failure or establish its cause. The exact full-run log is `/tmp/context-maturity-make-test-52b54573-built.log`. No source was changed during these runs. The release branch has since advanced beyond this tested base; the implementation must be rebased and requalified at its current tip before making a release-level claim. Hosted checks, installed acceptance, independent review, and a clean exact-current full-suite run remain outstanding. No live inference was used and no inference provider, PR, release tag, or remote branch was changed.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":70439071}},"started_at_ms":1795492676805,"completed_at_ms":1795492677876}}
